<title>NETHERLANDS: KAS-ASS FIRST-HALF NET SURGES 93 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>KAS-ASS FIRST-HALF NET SURGES 93 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.49 vs   2.32</p>
<p>    Net profit			    12.9  vs   6.7</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)	1.65 vs   1.35</p>
<p>    Total income			  70.8  vs  57.2</p>
<p>    Total costs			   51.4  vs  47.3</p>
<p>    Tax					6.5  vs   3.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Kas-Associatie NV, the bank for the Dutch equity</p>
<p>trade, said in July it expected the 1996 first-half net profit</p>
<p>to rise by more than 90 percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
